+- **File:** `AEPMessaging/Tests/UnitTests/MessagingTests.swift:1686–1714`
+- **What:** The test sets `mockNetworkConnectivityService.isAvailable = false` and asserts (1) completion handler returns `false` and (2) no Edge events are dispatched. `isNetworkAvailable()` hardcodes `return true` and never queries the mock service. `fetchPropositions` is called, Edge events are dispatched, and both assertions fail.
+- **Why:** The test gives false confidence in the offline gate and is a hard CI failure on every run.
